   "text": "A: My feed is all cooking videos now.\nB: Did you watch one last week?\nA: One. Maybe two.\nB: That is all it takes.\nA: It feels a bit creepy, honestly.\nB: It is just guessing from your clicks.\nA: Can I reset it somehow?\nB: Clear the history, then search for something new.\nA: Like documentaries?\nB: Exactly. Train it on purpose.\nA: So I am the teacher here.\nB: You always were. You just did not notice.",
