   "text": "A: I got a text about an undelivered parcel.\nB: Asking for a small payment?\nA: Two pounds. It looked real.\nB: Classic scam. Do not click it.\nA: But I am expecting a parcel.\nB: They know. Everyone is.\nA: How do I check properly?\nB: Open the delivery app yourself.\nA: Nothing there. No missed delivery.\nB: There you are. Delete the message.\nA: I nearly fell for it.\nB: Anyone can. Just never click the link.",
