   "x": "副词修饰动词、形容词或整句，多数由形容词加 -ly 构成：clear → clearly。频度副词（always, often, rarely）放在实义动词前、be 动词后：She always rehearses. / He is always nervous. 方式副词通常放在动词或宾语之后：She spoke clearly. / He delivered the talk confidently. 句子副词可放句首并用逗号隔开：Honestly, I was terrified. 易错：She spoke clear 应为 She spoke clearly。",
