   "x": "短形容词加 -er/-est：fast → faster → the fastest；长形容词用 more/most：useful → more useful → the most useful。比较时用 than：Skimming is faster than reading every word. 最高级前用 the，常接 in/of：the most difficult chapter in the book. 表示程度可用 much / far / slightly：This method is far more effective. 不规则形式：good → better → best；bad → worse → worst。易错：不要说 more faster 或 more better。",
