   "part3": "Why do some students find academic writing so difficult? / Should universities accept less formal writing styles? / Is it fair to expect international students to write like native speakers? / How has the internet affected plagiarism?",
   "useful": "The evidence suggests that / It could be argued that / This is not to say that / A possible explanation is / On balance, the data indicate"
