   "text": "A: Sara is leaving in three weeks and she is the only one who understands the billing process.\nB: Then there is your priority for the next three weeks.\nA: She says she will write a document.\nB: A document about what, exactly?\nA: The billing process, I suppose.\nB: That will be forty pages nobody reads. Ask her something narrower.\nA: Such as?\nB: What questions do people ask her most often?\nA: Refunds in foreign currency, mainly. And annual invoices.\nB: Then those are the two pages. Title them as questions.\nA: Why as questions?\nB: Because that is what people type when they search.\nA: We already have a shared drive full of guides.\nB: Does anyone use it?\nA: Honestly, we usually just ask Sara.\nB: Which is why you have this problem now.\nA: So we need someone to maintain it.\nB: Yes. And delete anything that is out of date, or nobody will trust it.",
