   "t": "定语从句（关系代词 who / which / that）",
   "x": "定语从句用来修饰前面的名词。指人用 who，指物用 which，两者都可用 that：The guide who showed us the temple was a student. / The village which we visited is very small.。当关系代词作从句的宾语时可以省略：The village (that) we visited is small.；作主语时不能省略。注意不要重复宾语，不能说 The village which we visited it。另外，which 前有逗号时是非限制性从句，补充说明：We stayed in Lisbon, which is famous for its trams.",
