   "text": "A: So, are you going to book that island trip in July?\nB: I am, but I am worried it will be completely packed.\nA: July is the worst month. Everything is going to be twice the price.\nB: I know. My friend says we should go in late September instead.\nA: That is much better. The sea is still warm and the crowds have gone.\nB: Will the ferries still run that late?\nA: Yes, but less often. You will need to check the timetable carefully.\nB: Fine. I will move the dates tonight before the flights sell out.\nA: Good idea. And stay in a guesthouse, not a resort.\nB: Definitely. It is cheaper, and you actually meet the people who live there.",
