   "text": "A: You are late. Where have you been?\nB: Walking. I have been exploring the old town since two o clock.\nA: For three hours? Did you not get bored?\nB: Not at all. I stumbled upon a covered market that is not in any guidebook.\nA: I have lived here for years and I have never noticed a market there.\nB: That is my point. You take the metro everywhere.\nA: True. I have been using the same three stations since I moved.\nB: Try walking home one evening. You will see a completely different city.\nA: My feet are already complaining, but all right.\nB: Start with the river path. It is flat, and it takes about forty minutes.",
