   "text": "A: Your holiday photos look professional. What camera did you use?\nB: Just my phone, honestly. I stopped carrying the big camera years ago.\nA: Really? Mine always come out blurry or too dark.\nB: Are you shooting in the middle of the day?\nA: Usually, yes. That is when we are out walking.\nB: That is the problem. Try going out early, before eight, and see the difference.\nA: I am not sure I can persuade my family to get up at six.\nB: Then avoid pointing the camera at the sun, and move closer to your subject.\nA: How much do you edit afterwards?\nB: Very little. I adjust the brightness and delete about ninety per cent of them.",
