   "card": "Describe a photograph you like. You should say: what is in it; who took it; when it was taken; and explain why it is important to you.",
   "part3": "Why do people take so many photographs today? / Have smartphones made photography better or worse? / Is it acceptable to photograph strangers in public? / Do photographs help us remember, or replace our memories?",
