   "x": "第一类条件句表示很可能发生的情况，结构是 If + 一般现在时, will + 动词原形：If you water them daily, they will grow quickly.。if 从句中不能用 will，不能说 If it will rain。will 也可以换成 may / might / can 或祈使句：If the soil is dry, add some water.。unless 相当于 if not：Unless you move it into the sun, it will die.。如果两个动作都是普遍事实，则两边都用一般现在时：If you plant basil in shade, it grows slowly.",
