   "x": "说明食谱和步骤时用祈使句，动词用原形，不加主语：Preheat the oven. / Add the salt slowly.。否定祈使句用 Do not + 动词原形：Do not open the oven door.。表示顺序用 first, then, next, after that, finally：First, mix the flour and water. Then knead for ten minutes.。表示时间条件用 until, when, once：Bake until the crust turns golden. / Once the dough has doubled, shape it.。语气可以用 please 或 make sure 缓和：Make sure the water is warm, not hot.",
