   "text": "A: I am having dinner with my partner's family for the first time on Sunday. I am terrified.\nB: Relax. What are you actually worried about?\nA: Doing something rude without knowing it.\nB: Just follow the host. Do not start eating until she does.\nA: Am I allowed to refuse food? Her mother apparently cooks enormous amounts.\nB: You can refuse politely, but take a little of everything first.\nA: What if I cannot finish it?\nB: You do not have to finish. Leaving a small amount is fine here.\nA: Should I offer to help afterwards?\nB: Definitely. Offer to clear the table. It matters more than anything you say.",
