   "x": "现在分词短语可以作状语，表示同时发生的动作或原因，主语必须与主句一致：Walking along the river, I noticed an old bridge.（等于 While I was walking...）。过去分词短语表示被动：Taken at sunrise, the photo has a warm tone.（照片是被拍的）。分词短语也可作后置定语，修饰前面的名词：The man standing by the door is the guide.（= who is standing）/ The photos taken last summer are the best.（= which were taken）。注意悬垂分词错误：不能说 Walking along the river, the bridge looked old.，因为桥不会走路。",
