   "text": "A: Have you finished that food series everyone is talking about?\nB: I binge-watched the whole thing on Sunday, which I regret slightly.\nA: Was it as good as people say?\nB: Visually, extraordinary. The footage of the salt harvest was unbelievable.\nA: But?\nB: But it barely mentioned money. Everyone smiles, and nobody explains how they survive.\nA: Does that matter in a food programme?\nB: I think so. It sheds light on the cooking and hides the economics.\nA: You are impossible to please.\nB: Not at all. Episode four was excellent, because they let the farmers speak for themselves.",
