   "card": "Describe a traditional health practice in your country. You should say: what it is; who usually practises it; whether you have tried it; and explain what people believe about it.",
   "part3": "Why do traditional remedies remain popular? / Should traditional medicine be covered by health insurance? / How should claims about health be regulated? / Do modern doctors spend enough time with patients?",
