   "text": "A: My hands shake before every presentation.\nB: Have you tried breathing exercises? They actually help.\nA: I have heard that, which honestly sounds too easy.\nB: It is easy, but the timing matters. Do it before, not during.\nA: What exactly do I do?\nB: Two short breaths in through the nose, then a long slow breath out.\nA: For how long?\nB: Five minutes. Or one minute if you are already in the corridor.\nA: Does it stop the shaking?\nB: It reduces it. My colleague, who used to hate speaking, swears by it.\nA: I will try tomorrow morning.\nB: Attach it to something fixed, like sitting down at your desk.",
