   "x": "时间状语从句由 when, while, as soon as, before, after, until, since 引导。核心规则：从句中不能用 will 表示将来，要用一般现在时：I will start running when the pain disappears，不说 when the pain will disappear。until 表示直到某时为止：Do not run until the physiotherapist agrees. as soon as 表示一就：Call me as soon as you get the results. 从句放句首时后面要加逗号：After I finished the exercises, I felt looser.",
