   "text": "A: Can I ask you something quietly? You have been skipping lunch for weeks.\nB: I am just busy. It is nothing.\nA: Maybe. But you used to come out with us every day.\nB: I do not really enjoy eating with people at the moment.\nA: That sounds hard. How long has it felt like that?\nB: Since the spring, I suppose.\nA: That is quite a long time. Have you spoken to anyone?\nB: And say what? Everyone will make it dramatic.\nA: I will not. I am asking because I noticed, not because I want a story.\nB: Thank you. I have thought about seeing my doctor.\nA: Would it help if I came with you?\nB: Actually, yes. That would make it easier.",
