   "x": "although 与 even though 后接完整句子，表示虽然：Although she slept eight hours, she felt exhausted. even though 语气更强。despite 与 in spite of 后接名词或动名词：Despite the long holiday, he still felt tired. / In spite of working fewer hours, she was still stressed. 常见错误是在 despite 后直接加句子，需要改成 despite the fact that。另外 although 与 but 不能同时出现在一句里。",
