   "x": "名词性从句可以充当主语或宾语。that 引导的从句常作宾语，口语中可省略：I believe (that) confidence grows slowly. what 相当于 the thing which，本身带有含义：What surprised me was the comment. whether 与 if 用于是否：I am not sure whether filters should be labelled. 注意从句要用陈述语序，不能倒装，不说 I wonder why is she upset，应为 I wonder why she is upset。",
