   "text": "A: Look at all this packaging. I bought four things and I've got two bags of rubbish.\nB: I know. Half of it can't even be recycled here.\nA: I've started buying rice and pasta from that refill shop on Green Street.\nB: Is it expensive? I always assume those places cost more.\nA: Slightly, but you buy the exact amount you need, so nothing is wasted.\nB: That's a fair point. Do you have to bring your own containers?\nA: Yes, any clean jar works. They weigh it for you at the counter.\nB: I might try it on Saturday. I need to cut down on plastic anyway.\nA: Start with one or two items. Changing everything at once never lasts.\nB: Good advice. I'll take a couple of jars and see how it goes.",
