   "text": "A: Do you know if this yoghurt pot can go in the recycling?\nB: It depends. Check the symbol on the bottom, and rinse it first.\nA: Why does it need rinsing? It seems like a waste of water.\nB: Because leftover food can contaminate the whole batch of plastic.\nA: I had no idea. I've probably been ruining our recycling for years.\nB: Most people have. The rules also change from one city to another.\nA: That's ridiculous. No wonder nobody gets it right.\nB: True. Honestly, buying less packaging is easier than sorting it.\nA: Fair enough. There's a refill shop and a repair cafe near my office.\nB: Take your broken toaster there. They fixed my lamp for nothing.",
