   "text": "A: There's a hosepipe ban from Monday. My garden is going to suffer.\nB: Have you thought about a water butt? You can harvest rain from the roof.\nA: Does it collect enough to be useful?\nB: One good storm fills two hundred litres. That's a fortnight of watering.\nA: I had no idea. Are they expensive?\nB: About forty pounds, and some councils sell them at half price.\nA: I'll look into it. I should probably fix the dripping tap too.\nB: Definitely. A slow drip wastes thousands of litres in a year.\nA: If everyone did those two things, would it really help the reservoir?\nB: Across a whole city, it would make a serious difference.",
