   "x": "表示目的最简单的方式是不定式：They planted trees to reduce flooding. 更正式的写法是 in order to 或 so as to：In order to protect the soil, farmers planted hedges. 如果目的从句有自己的主语，或需要情态动词，就要用 so that：They fenced the area so that deer could not eat the saplings. 注意否定目的用 in order not to 或 so as not to：We water in the evening so as not to lose water to evaporation. 不能用 for + 动词原形表示目的。",
