   "text": "A: This shampoo says it's one hundred per cent natural. Is that meaningful?\nB: Honestly, no. Natural isn't a legal term. Anyone can print it.\nA: So how do I know which products are actually better?\nB: Look for a certification with an independent auditor, not just a green leaf.\nA: That sounds like a lot of research for a bottle of shampoo.\nB: It is. That's why I mostly just buy less of everything.\nA: Fair enough. Do you boycott particular brands?\nB: Occasionally, though I doubt it worries them much.\nA: You sound quite cynical for someone who cares about this.\nB: Not cynical, realistic. What really changes things is regulation, not me.",
