   "text": "A: I tried talking to my father about heat pumps. It went badly.\nB: Did you start with climate change?\nA: Of course. Why, is that wrong?\nB: Not wrong, but he probably heard it as a political argument.\nA: He did, actually. He said he was tired of being lectured.\nB: Try the bills instead. He cares about not wasting money, doesn't he?\nA: Enormously. He still turns lights off in empty rooms.\nB: So do I, to be fair. Start there. Same technology, different conversation.\nA: That feels a bit manipulative.\nB: Not really. You're just talking about what he already cares about.",
