   "text": "A: We're thinking of going to Barcelona in August.\nB: Brave. It'll be forty degrees and completely packed.\nA: I know, but that's when we have holiday.\nB: Fair enough. Stay in a licensed hotel rather than an apartment, though.\nA: Why does that matter?\nB: Short-term rentals have priced a lot of local families out of the centre.\nA: I hadn't thought about that. Anywhere else you'd recommend?\nB: Spend two days in the city and then head inland. It's quieter and cheaper.\nA: That sounds better, actually. Fewer crowds, more authentic.\nB: And your money goes to smaller towns that actually need it.",
