   "text": "A: Can we talk about last night? I felt ignored at the party.\nB: I thought you were enjoying yourself with your colleagues.\nA: I was, but you didn't speak to me for two hours.\nB: I'm sorry. I didn't realise. I was stuck talking to Mark about football.\nA: It's not a big thing on its own. It's that it keeps happening.\nB: That's fair. What would help?\nA: Just check in with me once or twice. A look across the room is enough.\nB: I can do that. And you could rescue me from Mark occasionally.\nA: Deal. I'd rather sort this out now than let it build up.\nB: Me too. Thanks for saying something instead of going quiet.",
