   "text": "A: Did you go to the consultation about the old swimming pool?\nB: I did. The room was packed, which surprised me.\nA: What are they planning to do with the site?\nB: Two options were presented. Either it's sold to a developer, or it's leased to a community trust.\nA: And what do people want?\nB: Most speakers supported the trust. They said the pool has always been at the heart of the area.\nA: Can a small group really run something that size?\nB: Only if funding is secured. The trust has applied for a grant, but it hasn't been approved yet.\nA: So the whole scheme might never get off the ground.\nB: Possibly. Still, the building was written off five years ago, and now there's a real chance of bringing it back to life.",
