   "text": "A: You've been quiet all week. Is everything all right?\nB: Not really. I've got three deadlines and the entrance test, and I feel completely overwhelmed.\nA: That's a lot. What are you going to do about it?\nB: I don't know. I'll probably just work through the weekend again.\nA: That didn't help last time. Are you seeing anyone at the student centre?\nB: I'm meeting a counsellor on Thursday, actually. My tutor arranged it.\nA: Good. Honestly, you bottle things up too much.\nB: Maybe. It's hard to admit you can't cope when everyone else looks fine.\nA: They're not fine, they're just quiet about it. Come running with me tomorrow and let off steam.\nB: All right. I'll finish the essay first, and then I'll come.",
