   "text": "A: How did your first session at the mentoring scheme go?\nB: Better than I'd expected. I had imagined it would be awkward.\nA: Who were you paired with?\nB: A retired civil engineer. Before I met him I had assumed we'd have nothing in common.\nA: And did you?\nB: Quite a lot, actually. He'd worked on the bridge I cross every morning.\nA: That's a nice connection. Did you help him with anything?\nB: I set up video calls with his daughter abroad. He'd been struggling with it for months.\nA: So it goes both ways.\nB: Exactly. That's why it works. Neither of us feels like a charity case.",
