   "text": "A: Are you coming to the fundraising quiz on Friday?\nB: I'd like to. What are they raising money for?\nA: The night shelter. They need a new boiler so that the building stays warm all winter.\nB: That sounds urgent. How much do they need?\nA: Around four thousand. They've already had such a good response that they're halfway there.\nB: I'll chip in. Honestly though, I prefer giving monthly.\nA: Why's that?\nB: Because they can plan. A one-off donation is a drop in the ocean, but regular money pays for staff.\nA: That's a fair point. I'll set up a standing order too.\nB: Good. And come on Friday anyway — the quiz is how they find new supporters.",
