   "part3": "Why do many people not vote in local elections? / Should voting be compulsory? / How can councils involve young people? / Are online petitions an effective way to change things?",
   "useful": "It affects everyone who lives here / People feel their views are ignored / It's worth raising at the meeting / Something needs to be done about it / We should be consulted properly"
