   "x": "学术写作常把动词或形容词变成名词，使句子更客观简洁：People participate → participation；The scheme failed → the failure of the scheme。常见后缀有 -tion (contribute→contribution), -ment (involve→involvement), -ity (able→ability), -ness (aware→awareness), -ance (rely→reliance)。例如口语说 Many people joined, which surprised the organisers；书面可写 The high level of participation surprised the organisers。注意名词化不宜过度，否则句子笨重难懂。",
