   "x": "好的文章依靠衔接。表示补充用 moreover, in addition, furthermore；表示对比用 however, nevertheless, on the other hand, whereas；表示因果用 therefore, consequently, as a result, since；举例用 for instance, such as；总结用 in short, overall, to conclude。注意标点：however 作副词时后面用逗号并用句号或分号与前句分开——不能写 It was cheap, however it failed，应写 It was cheap; however, it failed。此外还可用代词与同义替换避免重复。",
