   "text": "A: I want to write a short story, but I keep deleting everything.\nB: Classic writer's block. What are you deleting?\nA: The first paragraph. It never sounds good enough.\nB: It is not supposed to sound good. It is a draft.\nA: So I just leave the bad sentences there?\nB: Leave them. You fix them later, in revision.\nA: That feels wrong somehow.\nB: Try this: write for twenty minutes without stopping.\nA: No editing at all?\nB: None. Editing while writing kills the flow.\nA: Okay. And then?\nB: Then read it the next day and cut half of it.",
