   "text": "A: Did you get tickets for the summer festival?\nB: I did, but only just. They sold out in twenty minutes.\nA: Who is headlining on the Saturday?\nB: A band from Ireland. Honestly, I am more excited about the small stage.\nA: Really? Why is that?\nB: Fewer people, better sound, and you can actually see the musicians.\nA: Are you going to camp, or come home each night?\nB: Camping. The last train leaves before the main set finishes.\nA: What should I bring if I join you?\nB: Boots, a raincoat and a power bank. Trust me on the boots.\nA: Sounds muddy.\nB: It always is. That is half the fun.",
