   "text": "A: I bought a set of paints and now I am too scared to open it.\nB: Blank canvas problem. What do you want to paint?\nA: Something simple. A cup, maybe.\nB: Good. You should draw it in pencil three times first.\nA: Three times? That sounds slow.\nB: It is slow, and it saves an hour of repainting later.\nA: Which colours should I mix?\nB: Only use three plus white for the first month.\nA: Just three? Will that be enough?\nB: More than enough. Too many colours make everything grey.\nA: Okay, and if it looks terrible?\nB: Date it and keep it. In six months you will see the difference.",
