   "text": "A: My friend wants me to join a salsa class. I have two left feet.\nB: Everyone says that. Have you ever tried?\nA: At a wedding once. It was a disaster.\nB: A wedding is the worst place to learn. Nobody counts there.\nA: Is a class really different?\nB: Completely. The teacher breaks it into eight steps.\nA: Do I need a partner?\nB: No, you rotate. That is how you learn to follow.\nA: What if I keep stepping on people?\nB: You will, in week one. By week three it stops.\nA: And the studio where you go, is it expensive?\nB: Ten pounds a class, and the first one is free.",
