   "text": "A: How is the exhibition coming along?\nB: Slowly. We have three rooms and forty possible works.\nA: Can you not show them all?\nB: We could, but crowded rooms make people rush.\nA: So how do you choose?\nB: The theme decides. Everything else goes back to storage.\nA: What is the theme?\nB: Night work. Artists who painted this city after dark.\nA: That is quite specific.\nB: Specific is good. It lets visitors follow an idea.\nA: Who writes the labels?\nB: I do, but I get a teacher to read them first.",
