   "part3": "Why are traditional crafts disappearing? / Should tourists buy local handicrafts? / How can technology help traditional makers? / Is globalisation harmful to local culture?",
   "useful": "it has been made this way for / you can tell it is handmade because / it is typically used for / sadly, fewer and fewer people / it would be a shame if"
