   "x": "however, therefore, moreover 是连接副词，不能像 but 那样连接两个句子。正确写法是句号或分号加逗号：The idea was good. However, it took too long. / The idea was good; however, it took too long。错误写法是 The idea was good, however it took too long。moreover 和 furthermore 表递进，therefore 和 thus 表结果，nevertheless 表转折让步。这些词在写作中提升衔接分，但每段不宜超过一两个。",
