   "text": "A: Can I ask how you manage to save? I never seem to have anything left.\nB: I automate it. On payday, money moves straight into a separate account.\nA: Doesn't that leave you short?\nB: A bit at first. But I also worked out where the money was actually going.\nA: Let me guess — coffee and takeaways?\nB: Exactly. Small amounts, but they added up to more than my phone bill.\nA: I should do the same. I'd like to save up for a trip next summer.\nB: Then set the target now. If you put aside eighty a month, you'll have nearly a thousand.\nA: That's motivating. Do you never splash out?\nB: Of course I do. I keep some money purely for fun, or I'd give up in a fortnight.",
