   "text": "A: Do you really sit down every Friday and review your week?\nB: Fifteen minutes, that's all. Three questions.\nA: Which are?\nB: What worked, what didn't, and what I'll change next week.\nA: Doesn't it get repetitive?\nB: That's actually the useful bit. When the same problem appears four weeks running, you can't pretend it's bad luck.\nA: What have you noticed so far?\nB: That I schedule hard tasks for Friday afternoon and never do them.\nA: So what did you change?\nB: I moved them to Tuesday morning. It sounds trivial, but it's saved me hours.",
