   "text": "A: Your flat looks different. Have you been decorating?\nB: No, I've just been getting rid of things. Two bags a week for a month.\nA: That sounds exhausting.\nB: It was at first. The hard part wasn't the objects, though.\nA: What was it?\nB: Cancelling things. I was on two committees and doing a class I stopped enjoying in 2022.\nA: And you finally said no?\nB: I did. It freed up two evenings a week.\nA: What do you do with them?\nB: Nothing planned. That's exactly the point — I'm not too busy to be spontaneous now.",
