   "text": "A: You're studying accountancy? You've run that shop for fifteen years.\nB: I know. Everyone thinks I'm mad.\nA: Is the business in trouble?\nB: Not at all. That's exactly why I'm doing it now.\nA: I don't follow.\nB: If I waited until sales dropped, I couldn't afford the course or the time.\nA: So you're building the next thing while the current one still works.\nB: Precisely. It's uncomfortable, but I should have done it two years ago.\nA: How long will you run both?\nB: Maybe three years. They'll overlap, which is exhausting, but safer than starting from nothing.",
