   "text": "A: I've been thinking about leaving publishing.\nB: And doing what?\nA: That's the problem. I keep waiting to know for certain.\nB: You'll wait forever. What would you try if you didn't have to commit?\nA: Honestly? Teaching. But I can't just resign to find out.\nB: You don't have to. Could you teach one evening class this term?\nA: I suppose I could. The community college advertises for tutors.\nB: Then do that first. If I had tested my ideas earlier, I'd be much further on now.\nA: You changed careers, didn't you?\nB: Twice. Both times I tried it at weekends for six months before deciding anything.",
